# This project is pnpm (see `packageManager` in package.json) and tracks pnpm-lock.yaml.
# Running `npm install` here drops a package-lock.json beside it; committing that gives npm and
# pnpm two different dependency trees for one project, which is how a build starts passing in one
# place and failing in another.
